    {
      "id": "claim_4e5e1ab0458345d6bfc5e1061afde4e1",
      "statement": "pebble-template-processor's cache-active configuration key genuinely defaults to true (Pebble's internal template cache enabled) when omitted; only an explicit \"false\" disables it. Earlier builds silently defaulted to false unless the key was present, despite being documented as defaulting to true.",
